## BreachPilot-style security workflow

For authorized security assessment, penetration-testing, vulnerability-validation, exploitability-research, attack-path, CTF/lab, source/artifact review, or recon-to-report tasks, load and follow `breachpilot-mindset/SKILL.md` before acting. Use its goal, scope, evidence, hypothesis, recovery, verification, and stopping guidance with tools actually available in this agent runtime. Do not assume the original BreachPilot backend exists.
